   "text": "① Blob = any file as bytes\nImages, video, PDFs, backups.\nThe database keeps only a\nsmall row about each file,\nnever the bytes.",
   "originalText": "① Blob = any file as bytes\nImages, video, PDFs, backups.\nThe database keeps only a\nsmall row about each file,\nnever the bytes.",
