   "text": "② Not the server's disk\nServers must stay stateless. A\nfile on server 1 is invisible\nto server 2 and dies with that\ndisk.",
   "originalText": "② Not the server's disk\nServers must stay stateless. A\nfile on server 1 is invisible\nto server 2 and dies with that\ndisk.",
