   "locked": false,
   "text": "③ Bucket + key\nBucket = top-level container.\nKey = the full name, like a\npath. Use a generated ID as\nthe key; the real file name\ngoes in the DB row.",
   "originalText": "③ Bucket + key\nBucket = top-level container.\nKey = the full name, like a\npath. Use a generated ID as\nthe key; the real file name\ngoes in the DB row.",
